        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "But be careful with these next options, because when you eliminate subjects of sentences and clauses, you risk cutting \"doers\" or characters and making your writing less clear (see Lesson 2 and 3).",
            "block_bbox": [
                115,
