        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Rephrase using a gerund or nominalization: You can use a gerund (a word of the form verb+ing that acts as a noun) or nominalization (a verb turned into a noun) to avoid repeating a \"doer\" or to cut it entirely (main subject underlined, gerund and nominalization italicized).",
            "block_bbox": [
